Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add unit tests for the extracted pure modules

31 new tests (node --test) covering the modules that used to be trapped
inside main.js and untestable:

- tests/utils.test.mjs     shuffle/randomItem/formatClock/planShuffle/
                           randomBoardShape, with seeded rngs
- tests/board.test.mjs     makeInitialBoard guarantees (grid size, exact
                           hazard share, starting triples) + ShapeBag
                           no-repeat and scarce-boost rules
- tests/trackers.test.mjs  Countdown (incl. the stop() park-at-submit
                           semantics), RevealTracker batches,
                           InventoryLimiter rolling windows
- tests/ai.test.mjs        AIPlayer memory (recall/mistake/forget rolls
                           via injected rand), groups/chooseGroup/guess
                           policies, aiCanTap truth table

Total suite: 73 tests, all passing.
